<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ to scrap surcharge at cost of NZ$306 million.</title>
<headline>NZ to scrap surcharge at cost of NZ$306 million.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Jim Bolger said on Wednesday the superannuation surcharge would be dropped on April 1, 1998, at a cost of NZ$306 million.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
